\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What if my child names the hamster after a friend who later moves away?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"This can be genuinely bittersweet but is usually manageable. The hamster and the friend become separate associations over time. You can gently use the hamster's full name or a nickname to differentiate. If it truly becomes painful, a gradual name transition is possible with patience.\\\"}]]}]\\n48:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Are there any names that are genuinely bad for a child's hamster?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Avoid names associated with anything your child finds scary — a beloved hamster should not be named after a monster from a nightmare. Also avoid names that are difficult for your specific child to pronounce. A name the child cannot say is a name that prevents full bonding and ownership of the pet relationship.\\\"}]]}]\\n49:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Looking for funny macaque names? Discover 60+ funny ideas inspired by music for your beloved macaque companion.\\\"}]\\n4a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"the-ultimate-guide-to-quirky-panda-names-120-ideas-for-every-panda-owner\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/blog/the-ultimate-guide-to-quirky-panda-names-120-ideas-for-every-panda-owner/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-